    "targetLevel": "Vice President",
    "summary": "Own the backlog and roadmap for the technical products behind our payments platform: payments APIs, the developer platform, and internal platform services built on Python, REST/gRPC, PostgreSQL, Kafka, and Kubernetes on AWS. Technical product owners write requirements and acceptance criteria for API and platform features, balance technical debt against new features, work through trade-offs with engineers and architects, and define the metrics that show whether a product is working.\n",
